# Skill: Compile Presentations
When asked to compile presentation slides, utilize the automated script:

- Execute `ppt\compile_all.bat` to iteratively compile all `Bab*.tex` presentation slides.
- The script runs all necessary `pdflatex` passes and automatically transfers the output `.pdf` and `.log` files to the `output/` directory at the project root.
